From fc205158306a9dc82e67f3c10e53ace363202373 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:27:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Trabis: Ratenkauf with manual VAT amount and free instalment
 schedule

- Full price (incl./excl. VAT switch) + VAT amount typed in; the rate is derived
  and shown. First payment = down payment (or first instalment) + all VAT.
- Instalment amount + how often (1/2/3/6/12 months or "I book myself"); number of
  instalments and the last one (rest) are worked out and previewed.
- Plans store `interval`; older plans default to monthly.
- Date field no longer overflows the sheet on iOS.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 8.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WrSmbPeJ9qpSAgv9M15c7v
